{"duration": 77.52, "segments": [{"scene": "hook", "text": "¿El árbol del vecino le está rompiendo la casa? ¿Quién paga?", "pause": 0.35, "start": 0.4, "end": 3.81, "words": [{"w": "El", "s": 0.4, "e": 0.58}, {"w": "árbol", "s": 0.58, "e": 0.86}, {"w": "del", "s": 0.86, "e": 1.0}, {"w": "vecino", "s": 1.0, "e": 1.48}, {"w": "le", "s": 1.48, "e": 1.6}, {"w": "está", "s": 1.6, "e": 1.8}, {"w": "rompiendo", "s": 1.8, "e": 2.28}, {"w": "la", "s": 2.28, "e": 2.42}, {"w": "casa", "s": 2.42, "e": 2.76}, {"w": "quien", "s": 2.76, "e": 3.18}, {"w": "paga.", "s": 3.18, "e": 3.62}]}, {"scene": "rafael", "text": "Don Rafael tiene un palo de mango enorme en su patio.", "pause": 0.25, "start": 4.16, "end": 7.28, "words": [{"w": "Don", "s": 4.16, "e": 4.36}, {"w": "Rafael", "s": 4.36, "e": 4.72}, {"w": "tiene", "s": 4.72, "e": 5.08}, {"w": "un", "s": 5.08, "e": 5.24}, {"w": "palo", "s": 5.24, "e": 5.54}, {"w": "de", "s": 5.54, "e": 5.58}, {"w": "mango", "s": 5.58, "e": 5.92}, {"w": "enorme", "s": 5.92, "e": 6.44}, {"w": "en", "s": 6.44, "e": 6.64}, {"w": "su", "s": 6.64, "e": 6.74}, {"w": "patio.", "s": 6.74, "e": 7.06}]}, {"scene": "danos", "text": "Pero las raíces ya rajaron la pared de doña Lucía, y las hojas le tapan el canal del techo.", "pause": 0.3, "start": 7.53, "end": 12.86, "words": [{"w": "Pero", "s": 7.53, "e": 7.73}, {"w": "las", "s": 7.73, "e": 7.89}, {"w": "raíces", "s": 7.89, "e": 8.37}, {"w": "ya", "s": 8.37, "e": 8.57}, {"w": "rajaron", "s": 8.57, "e": 9.05}, {"w": "la", "s": 9.05, "e": 9.19}, {"w": "pared", "s": 9.19, "e": 9.51}, {"w": "de", "s": 9.51, "e": 9.63}, {"w": "Doña", "s": 9.63, "e": 9.87}, {"w": "Lucía", "s": 9.87, "e": 10.39}, {"w": "y", "s": 10.39, "e": 10.75}, {"w": "las", "s": 10.75, "e": 10.87}, {"w": "hojas", "s": 10.87, "e": 11.25}, {"w": "le", "s": 11.25, "e": 11.37}, {"w": "tapan", "s": 11.37, "e": 11.75}, {"w": "el", "s": 11.75, "e": 11.85}, {"w": "canal", "s": 11.85, "e": 12.09}, {"w": "del", "s": 12.09, "e": 12.29}, {"w": "techo.", "s": 12.29, "e": 12.69}]}, {"scene": "reclamo", "text": "Doña Lucía le reclama:", "pause": 0.15, "start": 13.16, "end": 14.93, "words": [{"w": "Doña", "s": 13.16, "e": 13.52}, {"w": "Lucía", "s": 13.52, "e": 14.02}, {"w": "le", "s": 14.02, "e": 14.16}, {"w": "reclama.", "s": 14.16, "e": 14.68}]}, {"scene": "reclamo", "who": "lucia", "voice": "ef_dora", "text": "¡Ese árbol me está dañando la casa! ¡Córtelo ya!", "pause": 0.3, "start": 15.08, "end": 18.02, "words": [{"w": "Ese", "s": 15.08, "e": 15.34}, {"w": "árbol", "s": 15.34, "e": 15.72}, {"w": "me", "s": 15.72, "e": 15.92}, {"w": "está", "s": 15.92, "e": 16.12}, {"w": "dañando", "s": 16.12, "e": 16.52}, {"w": "la", "s": 16.52, "e": 16.64}, {"w": "casa.", "s": 16.64, "e": 16.98}, {"w": "Córtelo", "s": 17.26, "e": 17.58}, {"w": "ya.", "s": 17.58, "e": 17.78}]}, {"scene": "respuesta", "text": "Y don Rafael le responde:", "pause": 0.15, "start": 18.32, "end": 20.23, "words": [{"w": "Y", "s": 18.32, "e": 18.5}, {"w": "Don", "s": 18.5, "e": 18.72}, {"w": "Rafael", "s": 18.72, "e": 19.18}, {"w": "le", "s": 19.18, "e": 19.44}, {"w": "responde.", "s": 19.44, "e": 20.06}]}, {"scene": "respuesta", "who": "rafael", "voice": "em_santa", "text": "El árbol está en mi terreno. Yo no lo voy a cortar.", "pause": 0.35, "start": 20.38, "end": 23.42, "words": [{"w": "El", "s": 20.38, "e": 20.56}, {"w": "árbol", "s": 20.56, "e": 20.9}, {"w": "está", "s": 20.9, "e": 21.14}, {"w": "en", "s": 21.14, "e": 21.3}, {"w": "mi", "s": 21.3, "e": 21.4}, {"w": "terreno,", "s": 21.4, "e": 21.84}, {"w": "yo", "s": 22.12, "e": 22.22}, {"w": "no", "s": 22.22, "e": 22.4}, {"w": "lo", "s": 22.4, "e": 22.52}, {"w": "voy", "s": 22.52, "e": 22.72}, {"w": "a", "s": 22.72, "e": 22.84}, {"w": "cortar.", "s": 22.84, "e": 23.12}]}, {"scene": "lados", "text": "¿Quién tiene la razón?", "pause": 0.2, "start": 23.77, "end": 25.3, "words": [{"w": "¿Quién", "s": 23.77, "e": 24.05}, {"w": "tiene", "s": 24.05, "e": 24.35}, {"w": "la", "s": 24.35, "e": 24.55}, {"w": "razón?", "s": 24.55, "e": 24.87}]}, {"scene": "ladoL", "text": "Ella está sufriendo daños en su casa.", "pause": 0.2, "start": 25.5, "end": 28.11, "words": [{"w": "Ella", "s": 25.5, "e": 25.8}, {"w": "está", "s": 25.8, "e": 26.14}, {"w": "sufriendo", "s": 26.14, "e": 26.72}, {"w": "daños", "s": 26.72, "e": 27.16}, {"w": "en", "s": 27.16, "e": 27.34}, {"w": "su", "s": 27.34, "e": 27.48}, {"w": "casa.", "s": 27.48, "e": 27.78}]}, {"scene": "ladoR", "text": "Él tiene derecho a su árbol y a su terreno.", "pause": 0.35, "start": 28.31, "end": 30.96, "words": [{"w": "él", "s": 28.31, "e": 28.53}, {"w": "tiene", "s": 28.53, "e": 28.83}, {"w": "derecho", "s": 28.83, "e": 29.21}, {"w": "a", "s": 29.21, "e": 29.47}, {"w": "su", "s": 29.47, "e": 29.65}, {"w": "árbol", "s": 29.65, "e": 30.03}, {"w": "y", "s": 30.03, "e": 30.17}, {"w": "a", "s": 30.17, "e": 30.21}, {"w": "su", "s": 30.21, "e": 30.35}, {"w": "terreno.", "s": 30.35, "e": 30.77}]}, {"scene": "ramas", "text": "Lo que hay que saber: en general, si las ramas pasan a su terreno, usted puede pedir que las corten.", "pause": 0.25, "start": 31.31, "end": 36.96, "words": [{"w": "Lo", "s": 31.31, "e": 31.49}, {"w": "que", "s": 31.49, "e": 31.63}, {"w": "hay", "s": 31.63, "e": 31.77}, {"w": "que", "s": 31.77, "e": 31.91}, {"w": "saber,", "s": 31.91, "e": 32.23}, {"w": "en", "s": 32.59, "e": 32.69}, {"w": "general,", "s": 32.69, "e": 33.09}, {"w": "si", "s": 33.35, "e": 33.43}, {"w": "las", "s": 33.43, "e": 33.59}, {"w": "ramas", "s": 33.59, "e": 33.91}, {"w": "pasan", "s": 33.91, "e": 34.27}, {"w": "a", "s": 34.27, "e": 34.33}, {"w": "su", "s": 34.33, "e": 34.45}, {"w": "terreno,", "s": 34.45, "e": 34.93}, {"w": "usted", "s": 35.19, "e": 35.31}, {"w": "puede", "s": 35.31, "e": 35.67}, {"w": "pedir", "s": 35.67, "e": 35.99}, {"w": "que", "s": 35.99, "e": 36.21}, {"w": "las", "s": 36.21, "e": 36.35}, {"w": "corten.", "s": 36.35, "e": 36.81}]}, {"scene": "raices", "text": "Y las raíces que entran a su propiedad, las puede cortar usted